  "description": {
   "en": "The latest release from Circle [100h Suimin] is an IF story set in a world where Nagi’s \"smartphone trap\" never happened☆\n\nWhen Nagi saw the person he had bumped into in the hallway, he realized it was the son of a wealthy family.\n\nSeeing Nagi, the boy thought he had a good physique and told him to come watch if he was interested in soccer before walking away. However, Nagi had no interest in soccer, so he spent his days without any connection to it and eventually became an ordinary salaryman...\n\nEven though he became a salaryman without playing soccer, Nagi couldn’t shake the feeling that he was missing something more important. Despite not having seen him for years, the face of his wealthy high school classmate (Reo) kept flashing in his mind, and he began to feel that something was off."
  },
